DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nMaz Jobrani is one of the most celebrated comedians in the world\, kn
	own for his sharp wit\, cross-cultural storytelling\, and ability to conne
	ct with audiences from all walks of life. Born in Iran and raised in the U
	nited States\, Maz has built a career on finding the humor in the immigran
	t experience\, family life\, and the absurdities of modern society. \nHe i
	s a founding member of the legendary Axis of Evil Comedy Tour\, which aire
	d on Comedy Central\, and has released multiple acclaimed specials includi
	ng Immigrant on Netflix (filmed at the Kennedy Center) and his most recent
	 special The Birds and the Bees\, available on YouTube. Maz has appeared o
	n The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, The Late Late Show with James Corde
	n\, and NPR’s Wait Wait Don’t Tell Me. \nHis comedy is warm\, intelligent\
	, and universally relatable — whether you’re laughing at his parenting sto
	ries\, his observations about American culture\, or his hilarious takes on
	 international travel. Maz is a master storyteller who leaves audiences in
	 stitches from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 
	2026 \nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open approximately 6:30 PM) \nVenue: San 
	Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113 \nAge Restrictions: 18+
	 (valid ID required). Content may include adult themes. \nShow Duration: A
	pproximately 90 minutes to 2 hours. \nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv
	 is the Bay Area’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located in the heart of 
	downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. This intimate venue seats approximate
	ly 250-300 guests in a classic comedy club layout\, with tables and chairs
	 arranged for an up-close\, personal experience with the performer. \nThe 
	club features a full bar and food menu\, so you can enjoy drinks and bites
	 throughout the show. The intimate setting means every seat is a great sea
	t — you’ll feel like Maz is performing just for you. The venue has a livel
	y\, energetic atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special event. 
	\nParking is available in nearby garages and street parking throughout dow
	ntown San Jose. The venue is also accessible via VTA light rail and is a s
	hort walk from the San Jose Diridon Station. Arrive early to grab a drink 
	and settle in before the show begins. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a full-len
	gth solo stand-up performance by Maz Jobrani\, featuring his latest materi
	al. Expect a night of sharp\, culturally rich comedy that blends personal 
	stories with broader social observations. Maz is known for his energetic s
	tage presence and his ability to work the crowd\, making each show feel un
	ique and spontaneous. \nThe show typically runs 90 minutes to two hours\, 
	with Maz performing his full set. There may be an opening act to warm up t
	he crowd before Maz takes the stage. This is an intimate club setting\, so
	 the laughs feel personal and the energy is electric. \nWhether you’re a l
	ongtime fan or discovering Maz for the first time\, this is a night of com
	edy you won’t soon forget. Grab your tickets before they sell out — the Sa
	n Jose Improv fills up fast for headliners of this caliber! \nTicket Infor
	mation\nPrice Range: $43 – $100+ (fees may apply) \nTickets are available 
	through Ticketmaster/TicketWeb (official) and VividSeats (resale). Both op
	tions are backed by buyer guarantees. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\n
	https://comedycalendar.com/event/maz-jobrani-live-at-san-jose-improv/\n\nF
	rom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/maz-jobrani-live-at-san-jose-improv/
