	striction: 21+ with valid IDNote: Two-item minimum purchase per person req
	uired \nAbout the Venue\nThe Comic Strip is one of New York City’s most ic
	onic comedy clubs\, located at 1568 2nd Avenue on the Upper East Side. A l
	egendary launching pad for countless comedy careers\, this intimate venue 
	has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up. Accessible via the 77th 
	St (6 train) and 86th St (Q train) subway stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpe
	ct a high-energy late-night comedy experience with a rotating lineup of to
	p-tier talent from Netflix and Comedy Central. The live DJ soundtrack keep
	s the atmosphere electric from the moment you walk in until the last punch
	line lands. \nThis is the ultimate Friday night out in NYC — laughs\, drin
	ks\, and great vibes at one of the city’s most storied comedy venues. \nTi
	cket Information\nTickets are available through Fever. General Admission i
	s $25.00. Must be 21+ with valid ID. A two-item minimum purchase per perso
	n is required at the event. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/ev
