DTSTAMP:20260724T105419Z
DTSTART:20260725T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performers\nConcrete
	 (also known as DoKnow) is a Southern California stand-up powerhouse who b
	lends bilingual storytelling\, quick-fire crowd work\, and a DJ’s sense of
	 rhythm. He first turned heads with viral sketches and on-the-street chara
	cters\, then brought that energy to clubs and theaters across the country.
	 \nHis set moves from the comedy of family life to car culture\, from neig
	hborhood nostalgia to sharp observations about identity and hustle — alway
	s grounded in heart and razor-sharp timing. Expect punchlines that land fa
	st\, callbacks that sneak up on you\, and an atmosphere that feels like a 
	block party where everyone’s invited. \nJerry Garcia (the comedian\, not t
	he musician) is a rising stand-up star known for his relatable\, high-ener
	gy performances. Together\, Concrete and Jerry Garcia form the dynamic duo
	 behind the viral Perritos Only brand — a comedy movement that has taken s
	ocial media and live stages by storm. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, 
	July 25\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open approximately 7:00 PM)\nVenue: T
	he Magnolia\, 210 E Main Street\, El Cajon\, CA 92020\nShow Duration: Appr
	oximately 2.5 hours\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Ma
	gnolia is one of San Diego’s most beloved mid-size entertainment venues\, 
	located in the heart of downtown El Cajon. With a capacity of approximatel
	y 1\,100 guests\, it offers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere that’s pe
	rfect for stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features a full bar\, excellent sig
	htlines from every angle\, and a warm\, welcoming vibe that makes every sh
	ow feel like a special event. The Magnolia is known for its top-notch soun
	d system and attentive staff\, ensuring a premium experience from the mome
	nt you walk in. \nParking is available in nearby lots and street parking t
	hroughout downtown El Cajon. The venue is easily accessible from the I-8 f
	reeway\, making it a convenient destination for comedy fans from across th
	e greater San Diego area. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Perritos Only: That’s Not 
	Me Comedy Tour is a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud night featuring two of th
	e hottest names in bilingual comedy. Concrete and Jerry Garcia have built 
	a massive following through their viral social media content and now bring
	 that same infectious energy to the live stage. \nExpect a night filled wi
	th relatable stories\, crowd interaction\, sharp observational humor\, and
	 the kind of comedy that resonates deeply with Latino audiences and comedy
	 fans of all backgrounds. This is a 21+ event\, so come ready for an adult
	s-only evening of unfiltered laughs. \nThe show is expected to run approxi
	mately 2.5 hours\, including an opening set. Arrive early to grab a drink 
	and get settled before the headliners take the stage. \nTicket Information
	\nPrice Range: From $72 (resale) | Official tickets available on Ticketmas
	ter \nSecure your seats now before they sell out — this show is expected t
	o be a hot ticket in San Diego this summer! \nOfficial TicketsResale Ticke
	ts \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no ex
	tra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/perritos-only-present
	-thats-not-me-comedy-live-at-the-magnolia/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
