SUMMARY:Tony Rock LIVE at Arlington Improv (Sunday Show)
DTSTAMP:20260724T105419Z
DTSTART:20260726T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nTony Rock is a comedian\, actor\, and producer — the younger brother 
	of Chris Rock — who has built his own legendary career in stand-up and tel
	evision. He hosted HBO’s All Def Comedy\, BET’s Apollo Live\, and co-starr
	ed in CBS’ Living Biblically. He is also the founder of the MyROCK Diabete
	s Foundation. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 
	PM (Doors open 6:00 PM) \nVenue: Arlington Improv\, 309 Curtis Mathes Way 
	#147\, Arlington\, TX 76018 \nAge Restriction: 18+ \nPrice Range: $25 to $
	70 per person \nAbout the Venue\nArlington Improv is located in the Highla
	nds Shopping Center in Arlington\, TX\, across from Torchy’s Tacos. An int
	imate comedy club with a full bar\, restaurant\, and Black Dog Pizza Arcad
	e featuring 30+ local craft beers. Seating is assigned based on date of pu
	rchase. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Rock closes out his Arlington Improv weeken
	d run with a full Sunday headlining set. Expect sharp wit\, personal stori
	es\, and commanding stage presence — the perfect way to wrap up your weeke
	nd. \nThis is an 18+ event. Doors open at 6:00 PM. Food and beverage servi
	ce ends approximately 45 minutes into the show. All sales are final. \nTic
	ket Information\nTickets range from $25 to $70 per person. Purchase offici
	al tickets or find resale options below. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\
	n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv-sun
	day/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv-sun
	day/
LOCATION:Arlington Improv\, 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147\, Arlington\, TX\, 7
	6018\, United States Of America
